ote\", \"q\": \"A confirmed case of polio is defined as AFP and at least one of the following\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Per 100,000 children aged <15 years.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Population denominator data varied widely depending on the source and cannot be used to calculate coverage or total population.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}